{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3a716a01-015d-42fd-a919-c5a26999151c",
    "name": "Certgen API (portal)",
    "description": "APIs do Gerador de Certificados para o portal (spec, secao 11.1).\n\nAutenticacao: header X-API-Key com a variavel {{api_key}} do environment (RN-30).\n1. Saude -> 2. Verificar segurado (so leitura) -> 3. Emitir certificado (GRAVA no S3 e no banco) -> 4. Repetir emissao (ja_publicado).\nPasta 'Erros esperados' cobre 401/400/422/404.\n\nPasso a passo: docs/TESTE-API-POSTMAN.md",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-API-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{api_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.environment.get('api_key')) {",
          "  console.warn('api_key vazia no environment: as chamadas vao dar 401');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Saude (testa a chave)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/saude",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "saude"
          ]
        },
        "description": "RF-18. 200 = chave, firewall e rota de rede funcionando."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('ok true', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().ok).to.be.true);",
              "pm.test('sem a chave na resposta', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include(pm.environment.get('api_key'));",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Verificar segurado (login do portal)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/segurados/verificar",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "segurados",
            "verificar"
          ]
        },
        "description": "RF-20 / RN-35 (14/09/2026). {existe: true} se o CPF/CNPJ tem alguma linha nao cancelada na administradora, sem olhar vigencia. Nao grava nada.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"administradora\": \"{{administradora}}\",\n  \"cpf_cnpj\": \"{{cpf_cnpj}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const v = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('so o campo existe', () => pm.expect(Object.keys(v)).to.eql(['existe']));",
              "pm.test('existe e boolean', () => pm.expect(v.existe).to.be.a('boolean'));",
              "pm.test('sem a chave na resposta', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include(pm.environment.get('api_key'));",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Emitir certificado (GRAVA S3 + banco)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/certificados/emitir",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "certificados",
            "emitir"
          ]
        },
        "description": "UC-12 / RF-18 / RD-29. ATENCAO: emissao real - gera PDF e JSON na pasta de saida, publica no S3 e grava link_certificado_aws no Firebird. vigencia = inicio_vig exato (RN-31). Pode levar alguns segundos (Chromium).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"administradora\": \"{{administradora}}\",\n  \"cpf_cnpj\": \"{{cpf_cnpj}}\",\n  \"vigencia\": \"{{vigencia}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('cpf so digitos', () => pm.expect(r.pedido.cpf_cnpj).to.match(/^\\d+$/));",
              "pm.test('tem certificados', () => pm.expect(r.quantidade).to.be.above(0));",
              "pm.test('todo item tem link+documento ou motivo', () => {",
              "  r.certificados.forEach(c => {",
              "    if (c.situacao === 'falha') { pm.expect(c.motivo).to.be.a('string'); return; }",
              "    pm.expect(c.link).to.match(/^https:\\/\\/.+\\.pdf$/);",
              "    pm.expect(c.documento).to.be.an('object');",
              "    pm.expect(c.documento.arquivo.link).to.eql(c.link);",
              "  });",
              "});",
              "if (r.certificados[0] && r.certificados[0].link) {",
              "  pm.environment.set('ultimo_link', r.certificados[0].link);",
              "}",
              "pm.test('sem a chave na resposta', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include(pm.environment.get('api_key'));",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Repetir emissao (ja_publicado)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/certificados/emitir",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "certificados",
            "emitir"
          ]
        },
        "description": "RN-33 / RD-29. Mesmo pedido de novo: devolve link e documento sem reemitir.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"administradora\": \"{{administradora}}\",\n  \"cpf_cnpj\": \"{{cpf_cnpj}}\",\n  \"vigencia\": \"{{vigencia}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('ja_publicado', () => pm.expect(r.certificados[0].situacao).to.eql('ja_publicado'));",
              "pm.test('mesmo link da emissao anterior', () => {",
              "  const anterior = pm.environment.get('ultimo_link');",
              "  if (anterior) pm.expect(r.certificados[0].link).to.eql(anterior);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('documento relido do disco', () => pm.expect(r.certificados[0].documento).to.be.an('object'));",
              "pm.test('sem a chave na resposta', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include(pm.environment.get('api_key'));",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
